WEBVTT

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:08.400
It's eating a boomer.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:23.050
The mad boomer has been
eliminated. Now return at once.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:23.850
Roger.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.180
Take this!

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:45.400
Hold it, you bastard!

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.420
You're late!

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.350
Idiot! You didn't need to do that.

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.620
Yeah, but...

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:22.410
Per your orders, the area has been closed.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.580
Ostensibly, it's due to the
ground being weakened

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.810
by an accident during construction.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.620
I don't think it will be a problem
since your affiliate Baratrom

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:31.080
was developing that area.

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:34.860
I dealt with the media in the usual manner.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.860
However, we can't say it was just
some terrorists using boomers,

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:41.290
so I guess we need to make up a story.

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.200
I leave it up to you.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.750
I understand.

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:51.730
A monster that eats boomers...

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:55.240
How interesting!

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.630
Increase the ratio of extension by 5%.

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:16.760
Yes, Sir.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:21.390
Sylia...

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:27.400
I think you were wrong about Nene.

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.840
I know that.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.040
What do you mean?!

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:42.120
Close the damn door, you idiot!

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.860
Why was the investigation cancelled?

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.000
We can't do anything about it.
This is an order from the top!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.100
We saw it! We saw the monster!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:55.240
Well, was it a boomer?

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.570
No, but...

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.940
What is our duty? Tell me!

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.070
To control boomer crime!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:02.040
Damn you...

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:03.810
I don't have to spell it out for you, do I?

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.050
I don't buy it!

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:09.520
Who the hell will eliminate that monster then?!

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.950
The TV networks aren't saying
a word about the monster,

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:13.850
and the report on that incident
was a complete lie...

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:17.520
Have you ever seen the news tell
the truth about our work?!

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:23.100
I have to tell you one thing.
That area has been closed.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.830
You can't touch this incident
even on your own time.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.400
Excuse us!

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:41.750
Idiot!

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.080
Take this!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.850
This pisses me off!

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:50.560
Don't get so excited.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.730
"Don't touch any troublesome matter."

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.830
That's the usual way our bosses
deal with things, right?

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.330
I can't believe you're so quiet about this.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.970
It might be possible to sneak into that area

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.370
from the remains of the underground city.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:09.060
I know you're not a guy who can keep quiet.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.040
What a great partner!

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:16.550
We're hopelessly linked together, idiot.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.230
Hi, Nene!

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.700
Good morning.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.300
Morning!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.140
Are you all right?

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.400
About what?

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.710
Well...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.210
Oh, yeah! Your bruise from last night!

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.580
I was wondering if you were okay or not.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.420
Oh, it's nothing at all!

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.320
Look! See, see?!

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.990
So what? You have some
muscular pain, don't you?

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:56.820
Well, maybe a little.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.860
I'm young!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.460
Oh no, Linna, are you already that old?

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:05.370
Well, it's nice to see you're fine!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.830
Bye.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.170
Nene-chan!

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:18.880
I'm not in the mood to play around.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.250
Sorry, Leon-pyon!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.350
"Pyon?!"

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.050
Hey!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.720
Actually, I have a favor to ask.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.380
About Priss?

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.930
Well, deal with it by yourself.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.400
Hey, what's that? What does
"about Priss" mean?!

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:38.300
I told you before. I have nothing to do with her!

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:41.840
I'll be in trouble if you use PC's
for private purposes.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.440
I haven't heard a thing about anything like that!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:45.840
Are you keeping something
hidden from your partner?!

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.900
The favor has nothing to do with her.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:11.160
How are things going?

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:15.140
Yes, Sir. Everything is prepared
to move underground now.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.200
Well, let them go then.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.170
Yes, Sir.

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:25.210
As I think you already know, this
is classed as a Special A secret.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.610
Nobody will ever find out about this.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.250
Absolutely.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:33.220
Even Chairman Rosenkrantz
is not allowed to know.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:36.820
That's why we chose the members
of this team so carefully.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:41.460
All the members swear allegiance
to you, Vice President Mason.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:48.800
I didn't think you would be
interested in such a monster.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.140
My interest is not in the monster.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.610
Then what?

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.840
Something beyond that thing.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.880
That monster eats boomers.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.740
Do you understand what that means?

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.950
Boomers might have been born in
the same place that monster was.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:05.080
It's possible.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.370
Why am I...

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.940
Why am I so frightened of this?

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:20.360
Welcome!

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.630
How much is this?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.530
I think it will look good on you.
You want to try it?

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.960
I was joking!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.440
A little adjustment of the arm, right?

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.310
Nigel finished it last night so...

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:39.740
Not that. That's no big deal.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.740
I've been working by risking my own life so far.

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:49.560
I don't know what happened,
but I was in trouble.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:51.790
I don't care if she gets herself hurt,

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:54.590
but I don't want to suffer for her mistakes.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.660
Are you talking about Nene?

00:08:56.660 --> 00:09:00.200
It has nothing to do with who's
right and who's wrong,

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:04.500
but I don't intend to continue
working with her like this.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.570
What do you want me to do about it?

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.010
Let her go.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:12.050
Nene can't do it any longer.

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:15.220
Boomers are becoming extreme in
their transformation to madness.

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:18.950
You should tell her not to go up
front. Use your authority, Sylia.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.710
Say, would you like to make a wager?

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:27.460
If you win, I'll make her leave the front,

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:32.800
but if I win, you have to do one
thing that I ask you to do.

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.980
I shaved the weight roller
guide by 0.7millimeters.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.480
I see. With the width of the
driving belt expanded,

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.980
the maximum speed can be increased.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.620
This muffler needs to be replaced.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.640
Right!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.790
Nene!

00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.120
Hi!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.230
I'm sorry about Sylia.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:10.330
Oh no, I don't mind that at all.

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:14.640
I'm sure she knows it was her fault,

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:17.910
but she's not the kind of person
who can apologize easily.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.680
It's just that...

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:31.550
I've been thinking that I might
be a drag on the team.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:37.130
Even Linna who joined us recently
has overtaken me.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:42.200
No, that's not true! I'm sure
you're useful somehow.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.670
Are you trying to make me feel
better by saying that?

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:54.550
Because of you, we get
information from the AD police!

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.850
Also, nobody can build a system
like that except you.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:59.250
You mean this one?

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:05.930
You don't understand what I'm telling you.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.390
Anyway, you're incredible!
Whenever an incident happens,

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:12.060
you instantly transfer all the
information into your server.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:16.700
What's the matter?

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.300
Oh my god!

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:22.980
Those two guys are missing along
with some light armored jackets.

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:25.970
They've gone to that place.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.700
Turn right at that intersection.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.410
Can we trust that map?

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:58.850
This is a top secret map Nene
downloaded from Public Safety.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:02.420
She stole this from a place not
even directors can access.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.480
She's impressive.

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:07.720
Are you sure she won't turn us in to the director?

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:11.320
Trust me. I haven't told her
about our coming here,

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:15.020
and I told her I needed the map
for a different investigation.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.070
This is the place.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.030
Underneath the 28th area.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.370
The home of the monster.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.770
What's that?

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.110
What are they doing in here?

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:34.080
Hey!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.200
The map doesn't include the
area beyond this point.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.800
In this situation, I'm going to stick with you,

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:26.920
even if we go straight to Hell!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.040
We've lost the beacon signal.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.800
It seems the only thing we can do
is to wait for them to come back.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.280
What's wrong?

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:42.150
There's a beacon on somewhere.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.380
A beacon?

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.860
It's from the 28th area. The signal
is coming from the 28th area!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.590
Does the signal relate to them?

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:58.360
I don't know. But the AD police
don't use a system code like this.

00:13:58.360 --> 00:13:59.800
Anyway, we're going, aren't we?

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.130
Yes, please!

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.200
What is this place?

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:17.380
Some kind of lab facility?

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.350
Look at the thickness of the walls.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.460
I guess the inside was protected
perfectly from the earthquake.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.530
However, it was left behind when
communications were cut.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.650
Now it's the monster's home I guess.

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:37.670
I wonder if the monster did this?

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:38.930
Be careful.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:52.050
Damn! Let us go! Let us go!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:54.250
What the hell?

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:56.450
It's the sonic wave that killed the boomers!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.130
I guess it doesn't work on us!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.690
Lucky us!

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:18.950
What power!

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.880
They were killed by this!

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:23.250
Leon!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:43.800
They're stealing our action even
in a place like this! Damn it!

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.840
This is it!

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:53.380
Well, well...

00:15:57.820 --> 00:16:00.220
How lucky! Emergency power is still active!

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.220
The facility is back online?!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:07.230
Collect the data! Bring the
computer system to full power!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.390
Report to the second, third and fourth trailers!

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:14.400
Sylia! Here comes the data on that monster!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.240
Sylia?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:21.170
That sonic wave affects the
formation of boomers.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.040
Why didn't I realize that before?!

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:26.780
My god!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:27.410
Sylia?

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:28.280
Mackey!
Sylia?

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:28.910
Mackey!
Yes!

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:29.850
Yes!

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.880
Prepare my suit!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:32.850
Hurry!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:38.260
It's no good! Our knuckle
bombs don't work on it.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.430
Nene, nothing yet?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.660
Wait a second!

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.200
My suit...

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.470
Can't move.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.640
What's wrong with them?

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:03.020
No, I can't move!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:06.520
Damn, I'm going to lose the bet.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:07.510
Bet?

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:12.430
If she screws up on the next mission, I lose.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:18.000
But if she does a better job than you do, I win.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.460
It won't happen.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.880
What should we do, Daley?

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:33.110
You're asking me?

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.440
I don't know what to do.

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:42.990
What's that?!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.620
Are you both okay?

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.620
Sylia, behind you!

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:57.700
Sylia!

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:58.640
Sylia!
Sylia!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:17:59.160
Sylia!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.440
Oh no!

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:14.320
Sylia!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.380
Sylia!

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:16.850
Papa...

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:17.820
Sylia!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.810
Hey, open your mouth!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.320
Your weak point is...

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:31.660
There!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:57.850
Damn!

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:06.130
The facility we found was
definitely the Bioscape Lab.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:08.930
They did some business in
boomer development,

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.900
but we didn't find the thing
you've been looking for.

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:12.870
I see.

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:16.540
That monster was created through
biotechnology experimentation,

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:19.710
and it was based on an ancient life
form from the Cambrian period...

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:20.680
Turn it off.
and it was based on an ancient life
form from the Cambrian period...

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:38.290
Now, Priss, you have to keep your promise.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.310
Oh no, you have to smile more!

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:50.770
Ready? Cheese!

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:59.520
Next Episode

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:04.190
I'm going back to my hometown in Kumamoto!

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:05.260
Well, not exactly.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:08.060
I'm visiting my parents' house for
a Buddhist memorial service.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:11.700
All of my relatives will be there, so
even though it's troublesome,

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.270
I have to go anyway.

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:17.470
I wonder why they were so firm
about me coming?

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:20.680
What? An arranged date? With whom?!

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:22.580
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
